{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Kassel, August 19\n\nMy dear Marie,\n\nI am well, as you will hear. This evening, while I was waiting in my room, Heinrich Beer and his wife came in unexpectedly. He has just returned from here and assured me that he found me well. It was a short, but pleasant encounter.\n\nIn addition, the weather today was pleasant for walking, and I strolled through the city a bit. The air here is fresh, which was very refreshing after the heat of the last few days. I also read a little and find the time here quiet.\n\nMy sons will surely be glad to hear from me that I am in good health. I often think of you in Berlin and of the work that awaits there. But I am enjoying this short break.\n\nYour\nG.W.F. Hegel"}}],"created":1795221264,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":170,"prompt_tokens":261,"total_tokens":431,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-4zjkasZqbsriLpQiCzpmt1LIrq1uZEpx","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":261,"prompt_ms":451.668,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.730528735632184,"prompt_per_second":577.8580727436968,"predicted_n":170,"predicted_ms":3971.813,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.501852071005917,"predicted_per_second":42.549838071429846}}